<!-- Begin content -->
<div id="page_content_wrapper" class=" ">
    <div class="inner">
    	<!-- Begin main content -->
    	<div class="inner_wrapper">
    		<div class="sidebar_content full_width">
    				
    	
    		    		<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="3244" class="elementor elementor-3244">
						<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5af89f40 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="5af89f40" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_background_parallax&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_background_on_scroll&quot;:&quot;false&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-20a4b324" data-id="20a4b324" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column" data-settings="{&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_link_reservation&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_link_sidemenu&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_scrollme&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_smoove&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_parallax_mouse&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_infinite&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_fadeout_animation&quot;:&quot;false&quot;}">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-303d5532 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="303d5532" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_link_reservation&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_link_sidemenu&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_scrollme&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_smoove&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_parallax_mouse&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_infinite&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_fadeout_animation&quot;:&quot;false&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="one fullwidth "> </div><div class="one withsmallpadding ppb_header " style="text-align: center; padding: 15px 0 15px 0;"><div class="standard_wrapper"><div class="page_content_wrapper"><div class="inner"><div style="margin: auto; width: 100%;"><h2 class="ppb_title"><span class="ppb_title_first">Cervecería </span>Giralda</h2><div class="ppb_subtitle">Bar de tapas de Sevilla en el hammam mejor conservado de la península ibérica</div><div class="page_header_sep center"> </div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="one ppb_card_two_cols_with_image" style="padding: 40px 0 40px 0; position: relative;"><div class="standard_wrapper"><div class="page_content_wrapper"><div class="inner"><div class="one_half parallax_scroll" style="width: 40%; position: absolute; left: 90px; padding: 40px; z-index: 2; block !important;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d99a1c;" data-stellar-ratio="1.3"><h2 class="ppb_title"><span class="ppb_title_first">Descubre</span>la historia</h2><div class="ppb_subtitle">Recuperación del hammam del siglo XII</div><div class="page_header_sep left"> </div><p>El restaurante Cervecería Giralda es un restaurante único y con una historia alucinante. En 2020 salta a la prensa el descubrimiento de los restos de un hammam del siglo XII. Su existencia ya era conocida, lo sorprendente fue la riqueza y el magnífico estado de conservación de sus luceras y pinturas.</p><p>Los propietarios contactaron con los mejores arqueólogos de Andalucía para recuperar el Patrimonio y compartir el tesoro con Sevilla. Su estudio y trabajo de campo, han servido para poner en valor la importancia de estos baños árabes en su época… <a href="/historia/">Ver más</a></p></div></div><div class="one_half parallax_scroll_image last" style="width: 60%;"><div class="image_classic_frame expand"><div class="image_wrapper"><a class="img_frame" href="https://i0.wp.com/cerveceriagiralda.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/historia.jpg"><img decoding="async" data-recalc-dims="1" class="portfolio_img" src="https://i0.wp.com/cerveceriagiralda.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/historia.jpg" alt="cervecería giralda historia" /></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="parallax " data-image="https://cerveceriagiralda.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/azulejos.jpg" data-width="1000" data-height="667" data-content-height="50"> </div><div class="one ppb_card_two_cols_with_image" style="padding: 40px 0 40px 0; position: relative;"><div class="standard_wrapper"><div class="page_content_wrapper"><div class="inner"><div class="one_half parallax_scroll_image" style="width: 65%;"><div class="image_classic_frame expand"><div class="image_wrapper"><a class="img_frame" href="https://i0.wp.com/cerveceriagiralda.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/restaurante.jpg"><img decoding="async" data-recalc-dims="1" class="portfolio_img" src="https://i0.wp.com/cerveceriagiralda.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/restaurante.jpg" alt="cervecería giralda cartel" /></a></div></div></div><div class="one_half last parallax_scroll" style="width: 40%; position: absolute; right: 90px; padding: 40px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e1e1e1;" data-stellar-ratio="1.3"><h2 class="ppb_title"><span class="ppb_title_first">Cervecería</span>Giralda</h2><div class="ppb_subtitle">Conoce el restaurante</div><div class="page_header_sep left"> </div><p>Después de un siglo en funcionamiento, el bar Cervecería Giralda sigue ofreciendo la mejor costumbre del tapeo en Sevilla.</p><p>Tras la restauración de 2020, se han puesto en valor los restos arqueológicos y se ha distribuido el restaurante en 5 espacios diferenciados. Conoce nuestra historia y elige tu espacio favorito… <a href="/restaurante/">Ver más</a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="parallax " data-image="https://cerveceriagiralda.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/1-zocalo-m.jpg" data-width="1200" data-height="605" data-content-height="50"> </div><div class="one ppb_card_two_cols_with_image" style="padding: 40px 0 40px 0; position: relative;"><div class="standard_wrapper"><div class="page_content_wrapper"><div class="inner"><div class="one_half parallax_scroll" style="width: 40%; position: absolute; left: 90px; padding: 40px; z-index: 2; block !important;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d99a1c;" data-stellar-ratio="1.3"><h2 class="ppb_title"><span class="ppb_title_first">Carta</span>de Tapas</h2><div class="ppb_subtitle">Sugerencias del bar Giralda</div><div class="page_header_sep left"> </div><p>Una carta de tapas tradicionales, recuperando los platos más icónicos de la histórica Cervecería Giralda. Además, opciones originales y tapas de vanguardia fruto del trabajo de nuestro equipo.</p><p>También cuidamos la bodega al detalle, con sugerencias procedentes del todo el país. Mira la carta completa, los menús, vinos, bebidas, alérgenos, todo en tu propio idioma… <a href="/menu/">Ver más</a></p></div></div><div class="one_half parallax_scroll_image last" style="width: 60%;"><div class="image_classic_frame expand"><div class="image_wrapper"><a class="img_frame" href="https://i0.wp.com/cerveceriagiralda.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/patatas-importancia.jpg"><img decoding="async" data-recalc-dims="1" class="portfolio_img" src="https://i0.wp.com/cerveceriagiralda.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/patatas-importancia.jpg" alt="" /></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="one withsmallpadding withbg " style="color: #ffffff; background-image: url('https://cerveceriagiralda.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/portada-giralda3.jpg'); background-size: cover;"><div class="standard_wrapper"><div class="page_content_wrapper" style="text-align: center;"><div class="inner"><div class="testimonial_slider_wrapper"><div class="flexslider" data-height="750"><ul class="slides"><li><div class="testimonial_slider_wrapper"><div class="testimonial_stars"> </div><p>Se come genial y el trato es estupendo &#8211; Pedimos rabo de toro (de morirse), alcachofas y choco con arroz negro. Todo buenísimo!!! De postre, surtido andaluz (pastelitos de hojaldre con miel). Para repetir una y otra vez.</p><div class="testimonial_slider_meta"><span class="post_detail" style="color: #ffffff;">Nuri H &#8211; Madrid</span></div></div></li><li><div class="testimonial_slider_wrapper"><div class="testimonial_stars"> </div><p>I didn’t have high expectations because we were close to Cathedral and many tourists go there. I assumed it would be mediocre at best, but was pleasantly surprised by flavor and tastiness of our meal. Each tapas dish was nicely prepared and presented and we eagerly devoured our meal. Kudos to the chef. Even our picky teen left satisfied. Our server was attentive, polite and efficient. On a street lined with many choices do not hesitate to enjoy your meal here.</p><div class="testimonial_slider_meta"><span class="post_detail" style="color: #ffffff;">Sandy B &#8211; Dallas</span></div></div></li><li><div class="testimonial_slider_wrapper"><div class="testimonial_stars"> </div><p>Perfetto &#8211; Un ottimo locale fronte cattedrale. Cibo ottimo servizio veloce e tanta pulizia. Consiglio vivamente un pranzetto</p><div class="testimonial_slider_meta"><span class="post_detail" style="color: #ffffff;">Samuele C &#8211; Cagliari</span></div></div></li><li><div class="testimonial_slider_wrapper"><div class="testimonial_stars"> </div><p>Excellent déjeuner en terrasse &#8211; Excellent déjeuner en terrasse avec assortiments de tapas ( camembert frit, croquetas&#8230;) tout est très bon et en dessert l assiette de pâtisserie andalouse est à tomber . À essayer sans modération , prix correct autour de 20€/ personne en fonction de ce que l on mange</p><div class="testimonial_slider_meta"><span class="post_detail" style="color: #ffffff;">Beatrice S &#8211; Lyon</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="one withsmallpadding ppb_header " style="padding-bottom: 0px !important; text-align: center; padding: 50px 0 50px 0;"><div class="standard_wrapper"><div class="page_content_wrapper"><div class="inner"><div style="margin: auto; width: 50%;"><h2 class="ppb_title"><span class="ppb_title_first">Haz</span>tu reserva</h2><div class="page_header_sep center"> </div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="reserva-giralda" class="one withsmallpadding ppb_text" style="padding: 30px 0 30px 0;"><div class="standard_wrapper"><div class="page_content_wrapper"><div class="inner"><div style="margin: auto; width: 100%;"><div align="center"><iframe style="width: 100%; min-height: 800px; border: none; overflow: scroll;" src="https://module.lafourchette.com/es_ES/module/683077-659ce"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4f86976 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="4f86976" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_background_parallax&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_background_on_scroll&quot;:&quot;false&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b0c37e2" data-id="b0c37e2" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column" data-settings="{&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_link_reservation&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_link_sidemenu&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_scrollme&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_smoove&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_parallax_mouse&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_infinite&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;grandrestaurant_ext_is_fadeout_animation&quot;:&quot;false&quot;}">
