		<div id="footer" class="">
	<ul class="sidebar_widget three">
	    <li id="text-5" class="widget widget_text"><h2 class="widgettitle">Cervecería Giralda</h2>
			<div class="textwidget"><p>Calle Mateos Gago, 1.<br />
41004 Sevilla</p>
<p><a href="https://www.google.co.th/maps/dir//Cervecer%C3%ADa+Giralda+Bar,+Calle+Mateos+Gago,+1,+41004+Sevilla/@37.3861622,-5.9937657,17z/data=!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0xd126c1a2bc9b3db:0x924de17ae0a0787b!2m2!1d-5.991577!2d37.386158" target="_blank"><i class="fa fa-map-marker"></i> Cómo llegar</a></p>
</div>
